# Documentation

- Update the existing canonical source; do not create parallel docs for the same fact.
- Separate current state, proposal, and decision. Label each clearly.
- Mark missing authority as `[OPEN-QUESTION]` or `[ASSUMPTION]`; never invent rail facts.
- Do not fabricate use-case/source/ADR traceability.
- Master-planning documents synthesise; they are not a second backlog.
- `planning/` remains the canonical epic/story/capability backlog. `work/` is operational overlay only.
- Authority matrix: `docs/standards/SOURCE-AUTHORITY-MATRIX.md`. Use-case method: `docs/requirements/USE-CASE-METHOD.md`.
